# r1116 phase 3 boot 1 (p3a), after ps15_a.qb: SQ-PS15-14 (rerun of SQ-PWG-82 on gate jar -19) and SQ-PS15-15 (acid in
# water, rerun of SQ-PWG-80b plus the unheated case). Power Grid jar jar_archive/pwg_gate/backportedPowerGrid-0.6.2-ce-19.2-19.jar
# (srv/mods only, PGJAR). Prereq rows copied from r1115/p2_r1.qb (boot check with the -19 version, SETUP9, -76, SETUP15);
# the 13 pwg probes are in srv/kubejs/server_scripts as zz_<name>.js.
pace 1

## SQ-PWG-P11B | boot check on -19 (not a row): version, recipes, probe checks, mixins
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect Power grid starting, prepare to be electrocuted
bootreject InvalidInjectionException|InjectionError|Critical injection failure|Mixin apply failed
bootreject ^(?!.*RuntimeDistCleaner).*(/ERROR\]|@Redirect|conflict).*powergrid\.mixins\.json
> forceload add 1090 990 1140 1260
> forceload add 1090 1695 1130 1800
> forceload add 1135 1855 1200 1915
> forceload add 1095 1995 1135 2085
> forceload add 1095 2095 1112 2112
sleep 10
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doFireTick false
> weather clear
> time set noon
> zpwg mods powergrid
waitlog \[zpwg\] done 30
> zpwg3 recipes powergrid
waitlog \[zpwg3\] recipes \d+ 30
> zpwg9c check
waitlog \[zpwg9c\] done 30
> zpwg10 check
waitlog \[zpwg10\] done 30
expect \[zpwg\] mod powergrid 0\.6\.2-ce-19\.2-19
reject \[zpwg3\] recipe powergrid:mixing/acid\b
reject \[zpwg\w*\] (error|config error|\S+ error)
look recipe count vs 116 on -17 (acid replaced by the pack script); zpwg9c recipes line mixing/acid= (pack script removes it)

## SQ-PWG-SETUP9 | clear the animals generated in the forceloaded chunks (not a row)
> kill @e[type=!minecraft:player]
sleep 2

## SQ-PWG-76 | (added r1114 phase 5: the chain source board for -78 to -82; missing in the first pwgr1 run) setup again (passed in pwg17): P9c forceload, zpwg9c check, chain source board for SQ-PWG-78 to -82
> forceload add 1135 1855 1200 1915
sleep 8
> zpwg9c check
waitlog \[zpwg9c\] done 30
shell grep -n -E 'powergrid\.mixins\.json|Mixin apply failed|InvalidInjection' logs/latest.log | head -20
> zpwg9 board 1140 -60 1858 resistor
waitlog \[zpwg9\] done 20
> zpwg9 bmap 1140 -60 1858
sleep 1
expect \[zpwg9c\] fluids acid=true flowing_acid=true block acid=true fluid type=powergrid:acid description=fluid\.powergrid\.acid$
expect \[zpwg9c\] acid source=powergrid:acid isSource=true flowing=powergrid:flowing_acid bucket=powergrid:acid_bucket block=powergrid:acid$
expect \[zpwg9c\] item incomplete_circuit registered=true maxStack=1 incompleteCircuitItem=true
expect \[zpwg9c\] acid_bucket contains powergrid:acid 1000$
expect \[zpwg9c\] circuit_schematic_holder circuit_board=true circuit_schematic=true unetched_circuit=true incomplete_unetched_circuit=true incomplete_circuit=true$
expect \[zpwg9c\] fluid tag powergrid:acid source=true flowing=true$
expect \[zpwg9c\] recipes P9c mixing/acid=false mixing/etched_circuit_board=true sequenced_assembly/unetched_circuit_board=true cutting/empty_circuit_slabs=true deploying/schematic_copy=true sequenced_assembly/battery=true$
expect \[zpwg9c\] recipes P9d \(absent\) sequenced_assembly/electrical_gizmo=true deploying/electrobaton_boosting=true deploying/portable_drill_boosting=true$
expect \[zpwg9c\] mixin RecipeApplier powergrid:incomplete_circuit x1 Schematic components=0 schematicCopied=true$
expect \[zpwg9c\] damage acid source=acid acidSource=true$
expect \[zpwg9\] board at 1140 -60 1858 .*components=3 terminals=2
expect \[zpwg9\] bundle \d+: connector@0,6#0\* resistor@5,6#0$
expect \[zpwg9\] bundle \d+: connector@11,6#0\* resistor@5,6#1$
reject \[zpwg9c\] mixin RecipeApplier error
reject InvalidInjectionException|InjectionError|Critical injection failure|Mixin apply failed
reject An unexpected error occurred trying to execute that command
reject \[zpwg\w*\] (error|unknown subcommand)
reject ^(?!.*RuntimeDistCleaner).*(Exception|/ERROR\]).*(powergrid|patryk)
look the "recipes P9d (absent)" label is P9c's, all three =true since -16; shell: no mixin error line

