## SQ-PS15-15 | acid in water (D4): unheated basin, water first, rotten flesh + spider eye -> 250 mB acid; heated basin water first (SQ-PWG-80b) recorded; both acid recipes listed
> zpwg3 recipes powergrid
waitlog \[zpwg3\] recipes \d+ 30
> cdevtest recipes powergrid_acid
> cdevtest makes powergrid:acid_bucket
> zpwg9c basin 1150 -60 1894
waitlog \[zpwg9c\] done 20
> setblock 1150 -61 1894 minecraft:stone
sleep 0.5
> zpwg9c show 1150 -61 1894
> cdevtest state 1150 -61 1894
> zpwg9c bfill 1150 -60 1894 minecraft:water 1000
sleep 0.25
> zpwg9c put 1150 -60 1894 minecraft:rotten_flesh 1
> zpwg9c put 1150 -60 1894 minecraft:spider_eye 1
sleep 10
> zpwg9c show 1150 -60 1894
> zpwg9c show 1150 -58 1894
> say ps15 heated
> zpwg9c basin 1142 -60 1894
waitlog \[zpwg9c\] done 20
> zpwg9c bfill 1142 -60 1894 minecraft:water 1000
sleep 0.25
> zpwg9c put 1142 -60 1894 minecraft:rotten_flesh 1
> zpwg9c put 1142 -60 1894 minecraft:spider_eye 1
sleep 10
> zpwg9c show 1142 -60 1894
> zpwg9c show 1142 -58 1894
sleep 1
kjsexpect power grid recipes done
expect \[zpwg9c\] fill minecraft:water 1000/1000 at 1150 -60 1894
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=state pos=1150,-61,1894 state="?minecraft:stone
reject \[zpwg\w*\] (error|unknown subcommand)
reject An unexpected error occurred trying to execute that command
reject ^(?!.*RuntimeDistCleaner).*(Exception|/ERROR\]).*(powergrid|patryk)
look unheated 1150: tanks water 750 + powergrid:acid 250, no items left, no salt; heated 1142 (water first): record what ran (expected salt from water_salt, flesh and eye left, no acid; not a FAIL); recipes list both acid recipes; mixer speed non-zero

